  "details": "SDK 3.7.0-beta.1 (Happened in the past too with 3.5.1, maybe others)\n\nFile Packages/com.vrchat.worlds/Runtime/VRCSDK/Plugins/ImageLoader/MacOS/arm64/libvrc_image_loader.dylib\n\ncontains a raw LFS entry instead of the binary\n\n```\n\nversion https://git-lfs.github.com/spec/v1\n\noid sha256:877e4099e99fffb8baa40ffb81b4cff75c75fc4595dda2a189fd2f07c30392d1\n\nsize 1752742\n\n```\n\nthis breaks anyone using git with full package uploads from being able to push as seen below.",
